    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>Establishing a residential commercial complex facing the northern courtyard of The Prophet&rsquo;s Mosque, spanning over 5,800 square meters. The 20-storey complex comprises 360 <span class=\"HwtZe\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">apartment</span></span></span> and 234 stores.</p>\r\n",
